{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":30,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":30,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af6727ef4429d1fd72f7231","chatId":"45ba1fb32195479b81df2df420a0afb8","sessionId":null,"userId":99810,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"跟着起哄是安全的，因为话到嘴边还隔着一层，不用真的承认“这是我想要的”。那道从小养成的坎，好像连在朋友面前也还竖着。要是真把“我想要”说出口，你最怕接下来发生什么？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"跟着起哄是安全的，因为话到嘴边还隔着一层，不用真的承认“这是我想要的”。那道从小养成的坎，好像连在朋友面前也还竖着。要是真把“我想要”说出口，你最怕接下来发生什么？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":2219,"promptTokens":3315,"completionTokens":127,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:14:22"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":31,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.009707362401128435,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af6727ef4429d1fd72f7230","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794536062187,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:14:22","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af6727ef4429d1fd72f7230","chatId":"45ba1fb32195479b81df2df420a0afb8","sessionId":null,"userId":99810,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"跟朋友在一起的时候还行吧，她们聊什么我也跟着聊。不过……也就聊聊，真说“我想要”好像也没有。就是跟着起哄那种。<第15轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":30,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.009707362401128435,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af6727ef4429d1fd72f7231","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794536062184,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:14:22","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af67279f4429d1fd72f722b","chatId":"45ba1fb32195479b81df2df420a0afb8","sessionId":null,"userId":99810,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"“说了也是白说”——小时候那种失望攒多了，人就会学着把“想要”咽回去，好像不说就不会再失望一次。这份沉默其实是被教出来的，不是你的错。现在有没有哪个时刻、哪个人面前，你能稍微说出一点“我想要”？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"“说了也是白说”——小时候那种失望攒多了，人就会学着把“想要”咽回去，好像不说就不会再失望一次。这份沉默其实是被教出来的，不是你的错。现在有没有哪个时刻、哪个人面前，你能稍微说出一点“我想要”？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":2283,"promptTokens":3338,"completionTokens":139,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:14:17"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":29,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.00521986644309805,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af67279f4429d1fd72f722a","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794536057343,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:14:17","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af67279f4429d1fd72f722a","chatId":"45ba1fb32195479b81df2df420a0afb8","sessionId":null,"userId":99810,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"……可能吧。我好像确实很少承认自己“想要”。小时候想要什么，说了也是白说，慢慢就不说了。<第14轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":nu